the ceiling when `a < 0`. This includes `from - to ≥ 39`, where `10^(from-to)`
overflows `i128`, `checked_pow` returns `None`, and the code returns 0: that is
the correct truncation because `|a| < 2^127 ≤ p`. No hypotheses beyond the
direction. -/
