/-! ## `rescale_ceil` -/

/-- **`rescale_ceil` downscaling is the ceiling.** For every `i128` `a` and
decimal counts `to < from`, with `p = 10^(from - to)`, `rescale_ceil` returns
(never aborts) `⌈a / p⌉`: rounding up for `a ≥ 0` with a remainder, and
